ODE8106 [*] Use of external request method `requests.get` without timeout. It could wait for a long time
  --> external_request_timeout.py:10:1
   |
 9 | # Flagged: no timeout.
10 | requests.get("https://example.com")
   | ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
11 | requests.request("GET", "https://example.com")
12 | post("https://example.com", data={})
   |
help: Add `timeout=120`
   |
9  | # Flagged: no timeout.
   - requests.get("https://example.com")
10 + requests.get("https://example.com", timeout=120)
11 | requests.request("GET", "https://example.com")
   |
note: This is an unsafe fix and may change runtime behavior

